  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Calculator</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Calculator</h1>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"left\">First number</label>\n      <input id=\"left\" type=\"number\" step=\"any\" placeholder=\"e.g. -5\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"operation\">Operation</label>\n      <select id=\"operation\">\n        <option value=\"add\">Add (+)</option>\n        <option value=\"subtract\">Subtract (−)</option>\n        <option value=\"multiply\">Multiply (×)</option>\n        <option value=\"divide\">Divide (÷)</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"right\">Second number</label>\n      <input id=\"right\" type=\"number\" step=\"any\" placeholder=\"e.g. 3\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"calculate\" type=\"button\">Calculate</button>\n    <output id=\"result\" for=\"left operation right calculate\">0</output>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1c2c;\n  --panel: #29366f;\n  --accent: #41a6f6;\n  --text: #f4f4f4;\n  --error: #ff6b6b;\n}\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n.card {\n  background: var(--panel);\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--bg), 0 8px 0 4px #0f1020;\n  width: min(100%, 380px);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 20px;\n}\nh1 {\n  margin: 0 0 8px;\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n.field {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\nlabel {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\ninput, select, button {\n  font: inherit;\n  padding: 12px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--bg);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  background: #fff;\n  color: #1a1c2c;\n  outline: none;\n}\ninput:focus-visible, select:focus-visible, button:focus-visible {\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--accent);\n}\nbutton {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: #fff;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  transition: transform 0.05s, filter 0.1s;\n}\nbutton:hover { filter: brightness(1.1); }\nbutton:active { transform: translateY(2px); filter: brightness(0.9); }\n#result {\n  font-size: 1.75rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 12px;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  min-height: 3rem;\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n#result.error { color: var(--error); }\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card { padding: 24px 16px; }\n  h1 { font-size: 1.25rem; }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const left = document.getElementById('left');\nconst right = document.getElementById('right');\nconst operation = document.getElementById('operation');\nconst calculate = document.getElementById('calculate');\nconst result = document.getElementById('result');\n\nfunction compute(a, b, op) {\n  switch (op) {\n    case 'add': return a + b;\n    case 'subtract': return a - b;\n    case 'multiply': return a * b;\n    case 'divide':\n      if (b === 0) return null;\n      return a / b;\n    default: return null;\n  }\n}\n\ncalculate.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  const aRaw = left.value.trim();\n  const bRaw = right.value.trim();\n  const a = Number(aRaw);\n  const b = Number(bRaw);\n\n  const invalid =\n    aRaw === '' || bRaw === '' ||\n    !Number.isFinite(a) || !Number.isFinite(b) ||\n    (operation.value === 'divide' && b === 0);\n\n  if (invalid) {\n    result.textContent = 'Error';\n    result.classList.add('error');\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const value = compute(a, b, operation.value);\n  if (value === null || !Number.isFinite(value)) {\n    result.textContent = 'Error';\n    result.classList.add('error');\n  } else {\n    result.textContent = String(value);\n    result.classList.remove('error');\n  }\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Two-Number Calculator\n\nA small, offline, pixel-styled calculator built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. No packages, storage, or network requests.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a number in **First number** (negative values are supported).\n3. Choose an operation: Add, Subtract, Multiply, or Divide.\n4. Enter a number in **Second number**.\n5. Press **Calculate** (or focus it and press Enter).\n\nThe result appears in the output area. It shows only the numeric result, with no label.\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- Empty inputs, non-finite numbers, and division by zero display exactly `Error`.\n- The output starts at `0` on page load.\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- All controls have associated `<label>` elements and are keyboard accessible.\n- Focus, hover, and pressed states are visible.\n- Layout works from 360px wide.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – structure and labeled controls\n- `style.css` – pixel-themed styling\n- `script.js` – calculation and validation logic\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": ""
    }
